nds of information problems as individuals and departments can easily develop their own applications.\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td class=\"radio-cell\"><span class=\"custom-radio\"></span></td>\n                <td class=\"text-cell\">\n                    Parent/child relationship promotes data integrity.\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td class=\"radio-cell\"><span class=\"custom-radio\"></span></td>\n                <td class=\"text-cell\">\n                    It handles more relationship types, such as M:N and multiparent\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
